WEBVTT

00:35.827 --> 00:37.871
Our masters have returned home.

00:38.455 --> 00:40.999
Welcome home, master!

00:41.833 --> 00:43.960
Welcome. This way.

00:44.043 --> 00:47.464
Excuse me,
that maid's got the worst attitude.

00:47.547 --> 00:51.092
Miss Ayase!
Be more courteous, and speak clearly!

00:51.176 --> 00:52.010
Okay.

00:58.349 --> 01:00.852
Welcome, you bastard.

01:01.895 --> 01:03.730
Miss Ayase! How dare you!

01:03.813 --> 01:05.565
That should be, "Welcome home"!

01:05.648 --> 01:07.108
I'm sorry! It slipped out.

01:07.192 --> 01:08.735
- What should we order?
- This looks tasty.

01:08.818 --> 01:09.986
- Sounds good.
- Right?

01:11.404 --> 01:13.656
May we take your order?

01:13.740 --> 01:16.076
Pure apple juice!

01:16.159 --> 01:18.870
Let's see, then I'll have the tea.

01:21.164 --> 01:25.043
Okarun, you didn't want
to drink anything, right?

01:25.126 --> 01:26.669
Huh? Of course I'd like a drink!

01:26.753 --> 01:28.838
I mean, Miss Ayase is making an effort to...

01:28.922 --> 01:31.424
You said earlier that you didn't need any!

01:33.426 --> 01:37.514
May it get tastier...

01:37.597 --> 01:40.850
- Louder, please!
- May it get tastier...

01:40.934 --> 01:43.812
- May it get tastier...
- It's not getting any tastier, damn you!

01:43.895 --> 01:47.857
Pour some more affection into it, will ya?
That's right, that's more like it!

01:47.941 --> 01:49.859
You can do it
when you put your mind to it.

01:49.943 --> 01:51.736
Next time, yell from your gut!

01:52.695 --> 01:55.406
I'll murder-- your advice is appreciated.

01:56.407 --> 02:02.497
Then, to make it even tastier,
create a heart in front of your chest.

02:02.580 --> 02:03.706
What?

02:05.291 --> 02:06.918
All together now!

02:07.836 --> 02:09.420
Here we go.

02:09.504 --> 02:11.339
Ready...

02:11.422 --> 02:15.802
Moe Moe Tri-Beam!

03:47.018 --> 03:48.937
MOE MOE TRI-BEAM

03:49.020 --> 03:51.773
You guys are gonna regret this, damn it.

03:51.856 --> 03:53.524
You're doing a great job.

03:53.608 --> 03:55.610
I took an adorable pic of you, Momo!

03:55.693 --> 03:57.695
You said it was a restaurant!

03:57.779 --> 04:00.156
Maids are great, too. You look so cute!

04:00.240 --> 04:01.908
You're just here to make fun of me.

04:01.991 --> 04:02.867
Go home!

04:03.534 --> 04:05.828
All right, see ya. Great job. Keep at it!

04:05.912 --> 04:07.789
The path to renovation!

04:07.872 --> 04:09.040
Shoo!

04:13.378 --> 04:16.381
- Let's go, Okarun!
- Wait, hold on just a second!

04:16.464 --> 04:17.298
What's up?

04:17.924 --> 04:20.510
I'll stay here.

04:23.721 --> 04:26.057
Take your time!

04:30.853 --> 04:34.190
I'm sorry to barge in at your work.

04:34.274 --> 04:37.026
Like, really! Don't come here again!

04:37.110 --> 04:38.569
Man, I'm cold.

04:40.321 --> 04:42.282
Miss Ayase, how late are you working?

04:42.365 --> 04:43.992
Huh? Ten o'clock.

04:44.075 --> 04:47.287
Then I'll stay here
until your shift is over.

04:48.162 --> 04:51.791
You should go home.
It's cold, and you might get sick.

04:51.874 --> 04:55.003
It's dangerous for a girl
to go home alone at night.

04:55.086 --> 04:58.339
Oh no, but I'm tough,
so I'll be all right.

04:58.881 --> 05:00.800
I see.

05:01.718 --> 05:02.677
Well, then...

05:03.219 --> 05:04.721
Take care.

06:36.395 --> 06:38.481
Great job.

06:38.564 --> 06:41.609
I'm sorry to have caused
all sorts of trouble.

06:41.692 --> 06:43.861
Momo, you were great!

06:43.945 --> 06:45.279
Really?

06:45.363 --> 06:46.697
I'd like you to come back again!

06:46.781 --> 06:48.616
Okay! Good night!

06:48.699 --> 06:50.034
Take care!

07:28.823 --> 07:30.533
Guess I'll go home.

07:39.417 --> 07:40.626
Great job today!

07:41.294 --> 07:42.962
Are you done with your shift?

07:43.045 --> 07:45.673
Huh? What? I thought you went home!

07:46.340 --> 07:50.052
I can't let a lady be
all by herself this late at night!

07:50.136 --> 07:51.721
Let's hurry on home.

07:52.346 --> 07:55.266
Boy, it's cold.

08:08.821 --> 08:10.740
Since it's cold...

08:18.956 --> 08:19.916
Take that!

08:25.087 --> 08:26.214
Incredible!

08:26.839 --> 08:28.216
He's not budging at all.

08:28.299 --> 08:29.217
Tee-hee.

08:29.300 --> 08:32.261
Impressive. You learn real quick.

08:32.345 --> 08:34.847
- Manjiro, get some hot water ready.
- Okay.

08:34.931 --> 08:38.434
Jiji, stay put.
I'm going to try some soy sauce.

08:38.518 --> 08:41.437
- Oh, no!
- Master! Isn't it a bit too soon for that?

08:42.230 --> 08:44.106
Jiji, visualize it.

08:44.190 --> 08:47.193
As if steam is coming out
from every pore in your body.

08:47.777 --> 08:50.488
It'll be okay. Believe in yourself.

09:05.670 --> 09:07.838
All right. Here goes.

09:39.120 --> 09:40.413
That was close!

09:40.496 --> 09:41.372
Amazing!

09:41.455 --> 09:43.040
- Is this actually possible?
- So wicked.

09:43.124 --> 09:46.877
- Prodigies are pretty amazing folks.
- This takes away so much of my stamina.

09:46.961 --> 09:48.296
Don't let your guard down.

09:48.379 --> 09:50.631
You might be able
to handle room-temperature liquids,

09:50.715 --> 09:52.758
but you still can't handle cold stuff yet.

09:52.842 --> 09:56.345
But it's good to find out
that we can hold it back.

09:56.429 --> 09:59.390
Now, we might be able
to get you back to a regular life.

09:59.473 --> 10:01.058
I'm home!

10:01.142 --> 10:04.353
Huh? You're late!
What time do you think it is?

10:04.437 --> 10:05.605
I was at a part-time job.

10:05.688 --> 10:07.982
Part-time job? I didn't hear about this!

10:08.065 --> 10:09.609
Does it matter?

10:10.109 --> 10:11.527
So cold.

10:12.612 --> 10:14.739
I'll take this hot water.

10:14.822 --> 10:17.783
- What were you doing out this late...
- Momo, listen up...

10:38.512 --> 10:41.682
Evil Eye, stop it! Let me fight you!

10:48.731 --> 10:51.901
Stop it! Evil Eye!

11:37.279 --> 11:39.698
I'll take this hot water.

11:40.282 --> 11:44.078
That was close.
I'm glad I had some in my mouth.

11:49.208 --> 11:51.752
Momo! I'm sorry! I didn't...

11:51.836 --> 11:52.878
It's fine, it's okay.

11:54.463 --> 11:57.174
Miss Ayase, are you all right?
Can you breathe?

11:57.258 --> 12:00.136
I'm fine. I just got a bit scared.

12:00.219 --> 12:02.972
More like, did you see
my super fine play there?

12:03.055 --> 12:05.182
Please, Miss Ayase.

12:05.266 --> 12:08.602
But seriously,
my clothes are all tattered up.

12:08.686 --> 12:10.813
It's not your fault.

12:10.896 --> 12:12.356
- It's okay.
- You'll catch a cold.

12:12.440 --> 12:14.066
You should put some clothes on.

12:14.775 --> 12:17.069
Oh, if you're okay with my stuff...

12:17.153 --> 12:18.529
Thanks, Okarun!

12:23.576 --> 12:24.660
I'm sorry.

12:25.327 --> 12:26.454
For what?

12:26.537 --> 12:28.205
About earlier...

12:28.706 --> 12:32.168
Not much you can do, right?
These things happen.

12:33.169 --> 12:35.921
I'm sorry. I'll be more careful.

12:36.005 --> 12:40.176
Shush already, just go to sleep.
You're being all mopey.

13:14.835 --> 13:19.715
I wanna live in a village like this
Because, because

13:20.382 --> 13:27.389
The waves crash a-splashin'
Atop the sounds you're a-surfin'

13:27.473 --> 13:31.810
The waves crash a-splashin'

13:31.894 --> 13:33.354
Mr. Peeny!

13:33.437 --> 13:36.148
Someone claiming
to be your friend is here!

13:42.363 --> 13:46.534
A friend has come to visit me.
That makes me happy, deez!

13:46.617 --> 13:48.577
Oh my, Mr. Okarun.

13:48.661 --> 13:49.662
What? Mr. Mantis?

13:49.745 --> 13:51.413
What's with that look?

13:51.497 --> 13:55.042
I've always looked like deez
when I am on Earth.

13:55.125 --> 13:56.418
Wow, amazing!

13:56.502 --> 14:01.006
It really is true that aliens normally
blend into society by looking like humans!

14:01.090 --> 14:04.510
By the way, about how many aliens
are here on Earth?

14:04.593 --> 14:06.595
I don't know, deez.

14:06.679 --> 14:09.431
Mr. Okarun,
you need something from me, deez?

14:09.515 --> 14:11.141
Huh? Oh, right, sorry!

14:11.225 --> 14:14.019
Actually, there's something
I'd like to ask of you, Mr. Mantis.

14:15.062 --> 14:17.231
Please make me your apprentice!

14:17.314 --> 14:20.401
Please teach me how to throw a punch.

14:20.484 --> 14:21.694
I beg of you!

14:23.612 --> 14:24.655
No way, deez.

14:24.738 --> 14:26.156
Why is that?

14:26.240 --> 14:28.450
Violence is bad, deez.

14:28.534 --> 14:29.618
More importantly,

14:29.702 --> 14:32.955
can you help me
carry these sacks over there, deez?

14:38.961 --> 14:41.422
There's no time to rest, deez.

14:41.505 --> 14:44.008
Um, after I help with this,
can you make me your apprentice?

14:44.091 --> 14:45.259
No way, deez.

14:45.342 --> 14:46.927
Why?

14:49.013 --> 14:51.140
I'm not going to give up.

14:51.223 --> 14:55.769
I will learn how
to throw a punch tomorrow!

14:56.520 --> 14:58.022
I'm home!

14:58.105 --> 15:01.150
You're late, Four-Eyes!
Do you have a part-time job, too?

15:01.233 --> 15:03.736
Well, yes.

15:03.819 --> 15:05.905
Hurry up and eat your meal!

15:05.988 --> 15:07.907
I can't do the dishes until you do.

15:17.708 --> 15:19.585
We've really reached the limit.

15:19.668 --> 15:23.422
We survived this time
thanks to Miss Momo's quick thinking,

15:23.505 --> 15:25.758
but I doubt the same trick
will work twice.

15:25.841 --> 15:29.303
And living together with an evil spirit
is absurd to begin with.

15:29.887 --> 15:31.847
Let's call for the hayashi performers.

15:31.931 --> 15:35.392
If you won't do the ritual prayer,
then I will do it.

15:36.185 --> 15:38.520
All right? I'll go contact them.

15:38.604 --> 15:40.230
Hey, Manjiro.

15:41.565 --> 15:43.150
It's so rough.

15:45.152 --> 15:49.365
As an adult, you want to burden yourself
with all the kids' troubles,

15:49.448 --> 15:52.743
so you can tell them
to do whatever they like.

15:54.745 --> 15:58.290
It's the responsibility of an adult
to show them reality as well.

15:59.041 --> 16:01.710
I do like Mr. Jiji's spirit, too.

16:01.794 --> 16:04.088
But what's impossible is impossible.

16:08.550 --> 16:10.511
It's just so sad.

16:16.934 --> 16:18.852
Gotta make it snappy.

16:19.436 --> 16:21.480
What kinda dance is that?

16:21.563 --> 16:23.023
I'm not dancing.

16:23.983 --> 16:25.192
What a klutz.

16:25.275 --> 16:26.193
Leave me alone!

16:26.276 --> 16:30.489
Hey, why are you practicing how to punch?

16:30.572 --> 16:33.325
Because I want to become stronger,
of course!

16:33.409 --> 16:35.452
What are you gonna do by getting stronger?

16:35.536 --> 16:38.455
Is there someone
you wanna kill or something?

16:42.209 --> 16:45.087
I've been pissed off for a while now.

16:46.463 --> 16:50.592
I want to take Evil Eye
and send him completely flying.

16:54.513 --> 16:59.685
Do you wanna be able to throw punches?
Or do you wanna become strong?

16:59.768 --> 17:04.023
Well, I want to be able to throw a punch
so I can become stronger.

17:05.691 --> 17:07.985
No, you got it wrong.

17:09.028 --> 17:12.031
Even if you could throw a punch,
you wouldn't be stronger.

17:12.114 --> 17:15.409
Evil Eye is several levels above you
in both power and technique.

17:16.035 --> 17:17.995
He's got considerable speed, too.

17:18.078 --> 17:20.914
After all, he can keep up
with my abilities.

17:20.998 --> 17:23.876
What? Then what are you telling me to do?

17:24.460 --> 17:28.839
Just whose power do you think
you're borrowing, moron?

17:30.215 --> 17:31.967
Let me ask you one more time.

17:32.051 --> 17:34.053
Do you wanna be able to throw punches,

17:34.136 --> 17:36.930
or do you wanna become stronger?

17:37.848 --> 17:39.516
I want to become stronger.

17:39.600 --> 17:41.226
You turd nugget.

17:41.894 --> 17:42.853
Follow me.

17:44.438 --> 17:49.485
You're using my power,
but you're so weak. I don't like it.

17:50.277 --> 17:52.529
I have no choice, so I'll train you.

17:52.613 --> 17:54.865
Keep up with me
like your life depends on it.

17:57.743 --> 17:59.953
You wanted me to follow you here?

18:00.037 --> 18:02.289
Don't be modest. Just head in.

18:02.372 --> 18:05.042
This is bad!
If I get caught, they'll scold me!

18:05.125 --> 18:08.420
When you're getting a scolding,
just think of ramen or something.

18:08.504 --> 18:11.090
I'm saying
that I don't want to get scolded!

18:14.343 --> 18:16.011
Takakura, what are you doing?

18:16.678 --> 18:18.722
Miss Shiratori? You followed us here?

18:18.806 --> 18:20.933
What a turd of a roadblock.
Leave her alone.

18:21.016 --> 18:22.935
Please keep this a secret!

18:23.018 --> 18:24.645
Tell me what you're going to do!

18:24.728 --> 18:26.730
It's dangerous for you to come here!

18:26.814 --> 18:28.649
I won't leave until you tell me!

18:28.732 --> 18:30.609
Hurry up and go back, you half-wit.

18:35.656 --> 18:37.658
What's with this damn dumpling?

18:37.741 --> 18:39.868
Next time you trash talk me,

18:39.952 --> 18:42.287
I'll take that pukey furball face
of yours and crush it!

18:42.371 --> 18:44.748
Bring it on, idiot! You're dead meat!

18:47.000 --> 18:50.003
Okay! Both of you, be quiet!

18:54.883 --> 18:56.927
If that's the case, you should say so!

18:57.010 --> 18:58.720
I want to become stronger, too!

18:58.804 --> 18:59.638
Okay.

18:59.721 --> 19:03.058
And those filthy words earlier
were said by Acro-Silky, okay?

19:03.142 --> 19:05.060
Those were definitely not my words!

19:05.144 --> 19:06.270
Is that so?

19:06.353 --> 19:09.523
It is so! I could never
come up with words like that!

19:09.606 --> 19:10.482
Moron.

19:10.566 --> 19:12.901
Pukey, furball face sliced pork moron.

19:12.985 --> 19:15.571
Sounds like ya wanna say goodbye, huh?

19:16.238 --> 19:18.949
What's with this damn dumpling?
I'll crush you!

19:19.032 --> 19:20.242
These guys are hopeless!

19:56.987 --> 19:59.198
Takakura, I'm scared.

19:59.281 --> 20:03.493
I-It's all right! We have the powers
of yokai monsters as well.

20:04.036 --> 20:05.704
Whack!

20:07.206 --> 20:08.415
It's me, idiot.

20:08.498 --> 20:10.792
Do you want to be murdered, pukey furball?

20:10.876 --> 20:13.295
Takakura, I'm sorry! Are you okay?

20:13.378 --> 20:16.840
I'm totally fine.
Are you okay, Miss Shiratori?

20:16.924 --> 20:18.717
Oh, I'm such an idiot!

20:18.800 --> 20:20.761
Jump in sync with these notes.

20:20.844 --> 20:21.678
Why?

20:21.762 --> 20:24.097
Come on. You've got no time,
so hurry up and do it.

20:29.394 --> 20:30.979
There's an idiot jumping.

20:31.063 --> 20:33.106
Hey! What exactly are you after here?

20:33.190 --> 20:35.525
That's your combat rhythm.

20:36.318 --> 20:37.361
Rhythm?

20:37.945 --> 20:40.280
And then, this is Evil Eye's rhythm.

20:45.744 --> 20:47.037
You get it?

20:47.788 --> 20:49.456
This is yours.

20:51.124 --> 20:52.834
This is Evil Eye's.

20:52.918 --> 20:55.545
If I compare it to those jumps earlier,

20:55.629 --> 20:58.548
in the time it takes you
to jump once and land,

20:58.632 --> 21:01.760
Evil Eye will have taken
four full actions.

21:01.843 --> 21:05.806
What? He's faster than you, Turbo Granny?
That's why I couldn't shake him off--

21:05.889 --> 21:08.892
That's not it!
I'm ten billion times faster!

21:08.976 --> 21:10.978
I’m just talking about technique!

21:14.606 --> 21:17.109
Your rhythm is too monotonous.

21:17.192 --> 21:20.696
Basically, it's about how many notes
you can cram into one beat.

21:20.779 --> 21:26.576
What becomes important is the amount
of times you can switch actions in combat.

21:26.660 --> 21:30.622
Even that skank
can do a four-switch in one beat.

21:30.706 --> 21:32.541
Evil Eye is also a four-switch.

21:32.624 --> 21:36.628
Adding the cursed house's attack
would make him a ten-switch.

21:37.254 --> 21:39.548
You are a two-switch.

21:42.551 --> 21:44.469
That wasn't me.

21:55.230 --> 21:57.107
So noisy! Is that an orchestra?

21:57.190 --> 21:59.568
- Where is this sound coming from?
- They're here.

21:59.651 --> 22:02.654
Here? Who is?
The noise is so loud I can't hear...

22:02.738 --> 22:05.490
I hear filthy notes.

22:10.203 --> 22:13.665
Who is making such noise?

22:17.085 --> 22:18.628
Who is it?

23:53.515 --> 23:54.474
I'll never do it.

23:54.558 --> 23:55.851
- No, do it.
- No way.

23:55.934 --> 23:57.811
Come on, do you want to get fired?

23:57.894 --> 23:59.146
-Damn it.
- Yeah!

23:59.229 --> 24:01.857
Next episode,
"You Can Do It, Okarun!" And then...

24:01.940 --> 24:03.316
- Damn it.
- Do it.

24:03.400 --> 24:06.069
Moe Moe Tri-Beam!

24:06.153 --> 24:07.946
- Miss Ayase.
- Damn it!
